<title>JAPAN: Original Engineering plans share split.</title>
<headline>Original Engineering plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Original Engineering Consultants Co Ltd said on Friday it planned a 1.3-for-1 share split on February 20, for sharreholders as of December 31.</p>
